# Committed text is LF in every checkout. `syntaxes/hatch.tmLanguage.json` is generated
# from the core's language registry and compared with the committed file byte for byte
# (`test/grammar.test.ts`), so git's autocrlf on Windows would make the checkout differ
# from what the generator writes and fail the test. Patches and fixtures that need CRLF
# make it at run time, not in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf
